{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Tallied 是一款為桌上遊戲、飛鏢、卡牌與球類比賽而設的計分應用，用戶只需記錄每局實際發生的事情，程式便自動計算分數、排名與勝負，即使同桌無人熟悉複雜的計分規則亦能順利完成賽事。適合經常舉辦聚會、固定牌局或運動聯賽的玩家。原價 US $29.99 的終生版現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，內購限時免費期間可免費收下。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-150.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多人同步計分與賽事管理</h2>\n<p>程式支援共享群組，同桌各人以自己的 iPhone 同時記錄分數，配合語音輸入、Apple Watch 逐分計分與大螢幕即時顯示，全場都能掌握形勢。內建多款卡牌、骰子、飛鏢、球類與派對遊戲規則，亦可自訂計分方式；智能建議按人數推薦項目，規則助理即時解答疑難。玩家檔案與季度聯賽更會統計勝率、連勝與里程碑。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-154-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-155-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-156-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-157-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-158-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-159-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Tallied – Score Keeper 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Tallied – Score Keeper</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6824289370\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.847253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":490,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:34:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.777075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:20.639749+00:00","content_hash":"b0ec6ce703cd88812a870b6c7ea85e4ca90e2e63a0a34d3e58684fe819bc93c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.847253+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}